  "details": "Accessing the regular menu is more responsive than the new \"click on a person to access thier options\". Yes I know its possible to click on one person and scroll through until you find the one guy who you just want to mute/turn off avatar/etc, however that \"click on person\"-menu doesnt always work in a high lag map. If the \"turn off avatar\" button could just be added to the normal social menu it would help alot. The \"click on people\" menu is okay but we really need that avatar button to be added to the normal social menu.",
